# SWE-Gym, 2 nodes: node 0 = LoRA trainer TP2 x CP2 x DP2 (64k), node 1 = 4 SGLang engines TP2 (triton LoRA);
# Harbor agent servers on BOTH nodes (least-loaded dispatch), 64 sandbox slots; 8 groups x 8 per step.
# Measures multi-node sandbox placement and throughput scaling vs 1 node (same layout as Path A 2-node).
RUN_NAME=swegym-codex-lora-2n
HARBOR_TASKS_DIR=${HM_SHARED}/tasks/swegym-lite-v3/harbor
TASK_IDS_FILE=${HM_EXAMPLE_DIR}/configs/swegym-dfw-staged93.txt
HARNESS=codex
HF_CKPT=${HM_SHARED}/hf_home/hub/models--Qwen--Qwen3.5-9B/snapshots/c202236235762e1c871ad0ccb60c8ee5ba337b9a
ARM=lora
LORA_RANK=32
LORA_ALPHA=32
LR=1e-5
LAYOUT=disagg
TRAIN_GPUS=8
TP=2
CP=2
MTPG=32768
ENGINE_TP=2
MEMF=0.8
ASYNC=1
RBS=8
NS=8
MAX_STALENESS=2
NUM_ROLLOUT=500
MAX_SEQ_LEN=65536
MAXRESP=8192
SAVE_INTERVAL=2
DROP_ZERO_STD=1
HM_SANDBOXES_PER_NODE=32
HM_AGENT_TIMEOUT=1800
HM_REAPER_EXEMPT_MINS=60
HARBOR_MAX_SEQ_LEN=65536
HM_AGENT_TOOLS=codex
